WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.840
[Music]

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:46.520
[Three sailors jump out of a cab and post a sign on 
a car.]

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:59.240
[They head into a chapel for the wedding service.]

00:01:05.266 --> 00:01:10.260
[Minister:] Dearly beloved, we are assembled here 
in the presence of God,

00:01:10.266 --> 00:01:14.499
to join this man and this woman in holy marriage.

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:17.166
which is instituted by God,

00:01:17.166 --> 00:01:19.999
regulated by his commandments,

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.066
blessed by our Lord, Jesus Christ,

00:01:23.066 --> 00:01:26.932
and to be held in honor among all men.

00:01:26.933 --> 00:01:29.799
[Narrator:] To be held in honor among all men.

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:35.733
From the world of men and women, this one man, 
this one woman, choose each other

00:01:35.733 --> 00:01:38.033
to honor, love, and cherish,

00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:42.499
in sickness as in health, until death do us part.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:47.500
What is in the heart and mind of this girl as she 
pledges her thoughts, her body,

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:50.233
her life, to this man?

00:01:50.233 --> 00:01:52.599
Respect and admiration.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.700
Love and affection.

00:01:54.700 --> 00:02:00.033
Deep faith and a high hope for a good life together 
as man and wife.

00:02:00.033 --> 00:02:04.566
And if so blessed, in time to come, as mother and 
father.

00:02:04.566 --> 00:02:08.732
What is in the heart and mind of this man as he 
pledges his trust,

00:02:08.733 --> 00:02:10.199
his body,

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:12.866
his sacred honor to this woman?

00:02:12.866 --> 00:02:15.432
The answer lies in you.

00:02:15.433 --> 00:02:18.099
For the man is you.

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:22.333
You who once stood in this holy place and took 
part in this sacrament.

00:02:22.333 --> 00:02:29.833
And you who will someday stand before God with a 
woman you love, as this man stands today.

00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:31.533
Your answer may be freely given.

00:02:31.533 --> 00:02:34.466
For you may come to this woman as she comes to 
you,

00:02:34.466 --> 00:02:36.666
clean in body and spirit,

00:02:36.666 --> 00:02:41.360
as you enter on a new way of life in which the best 
is yet to be.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:45.740
Or you may have no answer that can bear the light 
of day.

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:50.560
For in your conscious may be hidden closets 
where dead things are stored.

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:54.500
Violations of the vows you took today.

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:58.080
This man then is you.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:00.466
And his answer is your answer.

00:03:00.466 --> 00:03:04.800
Freely given, or hidden in secret places.

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:08.440
"So God created man in his own image.

00:03:08.466 --> 00:03:11.366
Male and female created he them."

00:03:11.366 --> 00:03:29.632
[Music]

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:37.040
"And God blessed them. And God said unto them, 
be fruitful and multiply, and replenish the earth."

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:40.200
One man. One woman.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:45.466
Sanctified in the sight of God and in the presence 
of their fellow men,

00:03:45.466 --> 00:03:49.480
by sacred writ and ring as man and wife.

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:53.460
Given only to each other for ever and ever more.

00:03:53.466 --> 00:03:55.232
This is the law of God.

00:03:55.233 --> 00:03:59.633
This is the way of life for the children of God on 
earth.

00:03:59.633 --> 00:04:05.633
Reduced to the simplest terms, and applied to us 
as individuals, the standard for personal conduct

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:09.840
can be summed up in the question, how honest 
are you?

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:16.000
You won't cheat at cards; it's a matter of fair play 
and a sense of decency.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.900
So win or lose it's on the up-and-up.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:23.640
You're not a thief at heart, and you hold no truck 
with anyone that is.

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:28.640
But what about sex?

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:32.820
You men who are married, and you men who hope 
to be married some day,

00:04:32.833 --> 00:04:37.466
how honest are you when it comes to sexual 
indulgence.

00:04:37.466 --> 00:04:43.920
In terms of the moral responsibility to the decent 
women in your life, just how faithful are you?

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:51.733
In the long ago, when man and woman were new 
on earth and earth itself was young,

00:04:51.733 --> 00:04:53.799
possession was permission.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:57.400
Sex was the animal expression of primal instinct.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:09.500
[Music]

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:15.720
Historians of human life doubt and some deny that 
earliest man expressed such emotions

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:18.320
as love and affection for the mother of his children.

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:23.600
[Music]

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:26.933
But man had in him the spark of divinity.

00:05:26.933 --> 00:05:31.166
He grew in wisdom and he became master of the 
earth.

00:05:31.166 --> 00:05:34.699
He discovered in himself new evidence of 
character.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:38.566
Here man began to express the human values we 
call kindliness,

00:05:38.566 --> 00:05:39.599
friendship,

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:40.833
and tenderness.

00:05:40.833 --> 00:05:47.299
[Music]

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:50.666
The relationship between husband and wife, 
parents and children,

00:05:50.666 --> 00:05:56.399
has developed through the centuries into a natural 
expression of mutual trust and affection.

00:05:56.400 --> 00:06:02.333
The modern man living in honor and intimately 
sharing in family love brings permanent happiness

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:05.360
to his marriage and family life.

00:06:08.266 --> 00:06:12.700
Instead of the loose talk about women and sex you 
usually get in bull sessions,

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:15.300
let's have the real lowdown.

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:18.666
What are the facts about women and sex?

00:06:18.666 --> 00:06:22.140
Especially the business of illicit sex?

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:26.100
For the most part that's what it is, a business:

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:30.166
highly organized and highly profitable to those who 
run it.

00:06:30.166 --> 00:06:32.232
Not the girls themselves.

00:06:32.233 --> 00:06:35.133
They usually wind up with the least in terms of 
money,

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:38.560
and the most in terms of degradation and disease.

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:43.220
Where does the money go of those men who 
patronize prostitutes?

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:46.140
To the madams who manage the houses.

00:06:46.166 --> 00:06:49.799
Their cut is at least half of anything paid to the girl.

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:53.400
The gangsters and underworld big shots who own 
the business.

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:58.233
The vice syndicates whose take runs in the millions 
every year.

00:06:58.233 --> 00:07:02.633
The crooked police and politicians who sell 
protection.

00:07:02.633 --> 00:07:05.433
This is the financial pattern of prostitution.

00:07:05.433 --> 00:07:09.466
Money that supports a dirty business run by the 
scum of the earth.

00:07:09.466 --> 00:07:12.232
Debasing women and men who use them.

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:16.320
Spreading disease and supporting political 
corruption.

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:23.766
One of the chief arguments used to justify sexual 
indulgence outside of marriage,

00:07:23.766 --> 00:07:29.199
is that it's necessary in order to stay healthy and 
retain sexual power.

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:33.500
More nonsense has probably been spoken on that 
phase of sex than on any other.

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:39.660
The medical officer can give us the correct 
information.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.960
[Doctor:] Take his temperature.
[Nurse:]  Yes, sir.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:49.720
[Doctor:] I'll be with you in just a minute, boys.

00:07:49.733 --> 00:07:56.666
Often you've heard it said that unless the sex urge 
is satisfied when it develops,

00:07:56.666 --> 00:08:00.732
some emotional or even physical harm will 
develop.

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:05.200
No responsible physician would subscribe to such 
