medical grounds.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:41.700
Abstinence from sexual intercourse has no 
adverse effect on a man's health

00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:44.560
or his future sexual ability.

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:48.840
[Narrator:] The man who limits his sexual 
experiences to loose women

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:55.340
