00:13:47.166 --> 00:13:51.632
She belongs to him, only him, and he knows it.

00:13:51.633 --> 00:13:54.333
He belongs to her, only her.

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:56.980
And she's sure of it.

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:05.860
On this high human level, a man's sexual relations 
are associated with respect and tenderness.

00:14:05.866 --> 00:14:08.599
A real concern for his partner.

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:13.700
And other sentiments that any man has deep in his 
