00:14:18.066 --> 00:14:24.632
[Doctor:] How you men manage your sex life is a 
matter not only for the chaplain and the doctor.

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:28.080
It is also my responsibility as a commanding officer.

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:34.180
For those of you who consider it a service man's 
right to cut loose on leave,

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:39.640
here's a statement from one of our outstanding 
