00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:29.500
And as such, they're a man's own, private 
business.

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:35.400
But sexual relations never belong to this class.

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:38.800
They always affect another.

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:44.600
They involve sacred, human personality and a 
